{
  "info": {
    "name": "Buzfundr Node.js Blockchain API — Complete (with 7% Fee)",
    "description": "Direct Node.js API (Port 3001). All scenarios automated with auto-save variables.\n\n## Setup\n1. Start Hardhat: npx hardhat node\n2. Deploy: npx hardhat run scripts/deploy.js --network localhost\n3. Copy USDC to .env, set PLATFORM_FEE_WALLET, start: npm start\n4. Import this collection + environment\n5. Run scenarios in order\n\n## Fee Model\nOn successful release: 7% to platform fee wallet, 93% to issuer.\nOn fail/refund: 0% fee.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      {
        "key": "key",
        "value": "X-API-Key"
      },
      {
        "key": "value",
        "value": "{{api_key}}"
      },
      {
        "key": "in",
        "value": "header"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "if(pm.response.code < 300) {",
          "  try {",
          "    var j = pm.response.json();",
          "    if(j.vault_address) pm.environment.set('vault_address', j.vault_address);",
          "    if(j.tx_hash) pm.environment.set('last_tx', j.tx_hash);",
          "    pm.test('Success', function(){ pm.expect(j.success).to.be.true; });",
          "  } catch(e) {}",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🏥 Health & Info",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base}}/health"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Contract ABI (for frontend)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base}}/abi"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Blockchain Time",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base}}/time"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Auth Test (should 401)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base}}/vaults"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "✅ SCENARIO A — Happy Path with 7% Fee (Invest → Release → Fee Split)",
      "description": "Goal reached → 93% to issuer, 7% to fee wallet.\n\nMath: 1500 USDC invested → 105 fee (7%) → 1395 to issuer (93%).\nRun A1→A15 in order.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "A1. Recharge Investor1 with 5000 USDC",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var j=pm.response.json(); pm.test('Recharged', ()=> pm.expect(j.success).to.be.true);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"wallet_address\": \"{{investor1}}\",\n  \"amount_usdc\": 5000\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base}}/recharge"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "A2. Check Investor1 Balance",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base}}/wallet/{{investor1}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "A3. Check Fee Wallet Balance BEFORE (should be 0 or previous)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var j=pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('fee_balance_before', j.usdc);",
                  "console.log('Fee wallet balance before:', j.usdc);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base}}/wallet/{{fee_wallet}}"
